Subject: [PATCH] wineaaudio.drv: Add an AAudio audio driver for Android.

Wine's Android build had no audio driver since the OpenSL ES one was
dropped, so every program was silent ("No driver from pulse,alsa,oss,
coreaudio could be initialized"). Add one based on the OSS driver: its
ring buffer and timer loop feed an AAudio output stream through
non-blocking writes; AAudio converts sample rates and channel counts, so
only the sample format limits what is supported. The stream is reopened
when the output disconnects. Render only, no capture or volume control
yet; no MIDI or aux devices. mmdevapi tries it first.

On Android 17 desktop devices, low-latency or game-usage streams made the
audio server disable the Bluetooth (A2DP) port or drop the headset, so the
streams are plain media ones. Android only starts playing a stream once
its buffer was filled, which the program's data alone may never do
(Bluetooth buffers hold over 13000 frames), so a started stream is first
filled with silence, which the padding and position don't count.
---
diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index b8ae3db..f54c2f9 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -998,6 +998,7 @@ case $host_os in
     LDDLLFLAGS="-fPIC"
     LDEXECFLAGS="-Wl,-pie"
     enable_wineandroid_drv=${enable_wineandroid_drv:-yes}
+    enable_wineaaudio_drv=${enable_wineaaudio_drv:-yes}
     WINE_TRY_CFLAGS([-Wl,-z,defs],[UNIXLDFLAGS="$UNIXLDFLAGS -Wl,-z,defs"])
     WINE_TRY_CFLAGS([-fPIC -Wl,--export-dynamic],[WINELOADER_LDFLAGS="-Wl,--export-dynamic"])
     WINEPRELOADER_LDFLAGS="-static -nostartfiles -nodefaultlibs -Wl,-Ttext=0x7d400000"
@@ -1071,6 +1072,7 @@ esac
 
 enable_winecoreaudio_drv=${enable_winecoreaudio_drv:-no}
 enable_wineandroid_drv=${enable_wineandroid_drv:-no}
+enable_wineaaudio_drv=${enable_wineaaudio_drv:-no}
 enable_winemac_drv=${enable_winemac_drv:-no}
 
 dnl **** External libraries ****
@@ -3353,6 +3355,7 @@ WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windowscodecs)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windowscodecs/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windowscodecsext)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/windowscodecsext/tests)
+WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/wineaaudio.drv)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/winealsa.drv)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/wineandroid.drv)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/winebth.sys)
diff --git a/dlls/mmdevapi/main.c b/dlls/mmdevapi/main.c
index 66a6327..ba71244 100644
--- a/dlls/mmdevapi/main.c
+++ b/dlls/mmdevapi/main.c
@@ -125,7 +125,7 @@ fail:
 
 static BOOL WINAPI init_driver(INIT_ONCE *once, void *param, void **context)
 {
-    static WCHAR default_list[] = L"pulse,alsa,oss,coreaudio";
+    static WCHAR default_list[] = L"aaudio,pulse,alsa,oss,coreaudio";
     DriverFuncs driver;
     HKEY key;
     WCHAR reg_list[256], *p, *next, *driver_list = default_list;
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/wineaaudio.drv/Makefile.in
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+MODULE    = wineaaudio.drv
+UNIXLIB   = wineaaudio.so
+IMPORTS   = uuid ole32 user32 advapi32
+UNIX_LIBS = -laaudio $(PTHREAD_LIBS)
+
+SOURCES = \
+	aaudio.c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/wineaaudio.drv/aaudio.c
@@ -0,0 +1,1614 @@
+/*
+ * AAudio driver (unixlib), for Android
+ *
+ * Based on the OSS driver:
